57:09.375 --> 57:10.416
Deaw!

57:38.666 --> 57:41.000
Hei! Buka pintu!

57:41.083 --> 57:43.125
Kau nak buka tak?

57:43.208 --> 57:44.708
Kalau tak,

57:44.791 --> 57:46.708
